//! Types and interfaces of the musubi-sync core.
//!
//! This crate is the contract between the other crates of the workspace
//! (docs/plan/phase1.md, chapters 2–4). It depends on no other project crate and
//! performs no I/O: no files, no network, no clock and no randomness. Whatever
//! needs those receives it through a trait defined here ([`provider::Clock`],
//! [`provider::Limiter`]) or creates it itself (identifiers are generated by
//! the store, see [`id`]).
//!
//! Map of the crate:
//!
//! - [`id`]: our identifiers ([`TenantId`], [`EntityId`], …), [`Seq`] and [`ReadId`].
//! - [`kind`]: the [`Kind`] trait, the [`Event`] kind and [`EntityKind`].
//! - [`event`]: the canonical event ([`CalendarEvent`]), a JSCalendar profile.
//! - [`remote`]: what a provider sends: [`Raw`] content, [`Validator`], keys,
//!   [`Cursor`] and [`RemoteObject`].
//! - [`provider`]: the adapter contract: [`Provider`], [`PushSource`], [`Codec`],
//!   [`ChangePage`] and the account context.
//! - [`capability`]: [`ProviderDescriptor`] with the capabilities of proposal 6.2.
//! - [`placement`]: how an entity is bound to an item (roles, delivery state).
//! - [`journal`]: the change journal ([`Change`]).
//! - [`store`]: tenant storage ([`Storage`], [`TenantStore`]).
//! - [`control`]: the control plane ([`ControlStore`]).
//! - [`error`]: [`SyncError`], [`StoreError`], [`PushRejected`].
//! - [`time`]: the half-open [`TimeWindow`].

pub mod capability;
pub mod control;
